.TH KAERU 1 "2026-11-16" "kaeru 0.1.1" "Kaeru manual"
.SH NAME
kaeru \- keep awake, focus timer and honest work log
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kaeru
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Kaeru
prevents unwanted automatic system sleep (via the xdg\-desktop\-portal
Inhibit interface, with a systemd\-logind sleep:block fallback), optionally
keeps the display awake, runs focus intervals (countdown or Pomodoro) and
records a suspend\-aware work log with CSV export. It never modifies global
power\-management settings and never synthesizes input activity.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B (no command)
Open the application window.
.TP
.B \-\-background
Start without showing the window (tray only).
.TP
.B status
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
Show current status (keep\-awake state, focus, work log).
.TP
.B awake on
[\fB\-\-duration\fR \fI30m\fR] [\fB\-\-mode\fR \fIsystem|display|both\fR]
Request keep\-awake; optionally timed.
.TP
.B awake off
Turn keep\-awake off now (suppresses automatic requests until resumed).
.TP
.B focus \fIstart|pause|resume|skip|stop|extend\fR
[\fB\-\-duration\fR \fI25m\fR]
Control the focus timer.
.TP
.B work \fIstart|pause|resume|stop\fR
[\fB\-\-project\fR \fINAME\fR]
Control the work log recording.
.TP
.B export \fB\-\-format\fR \fIcsv\fR \fB\-\-from\fR \fIYYYY\-MM\-DD\fR \fB\-\-to\fR \fIYYYY\-MM\-DD\fR
[\fB\-\-output\fR \fIFILE\fR]
Export the work log as CSV (spreadsheet formula\-injection protected).
.TP
.B pause\-all | diagnostics | open | quit
Pause all modules; show capability diagnostics; open the window; quit.
.SH EXIT CODES
.TP
.B 0
ok
.TP
.B 2
usage error
.TP
.B 3
Kaeru not running
.TP
.B 4
failed
.TP
.B 5
permission denied
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/kaeru/
Settings (kaeru.conf).
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/kaeru/kaeru.db
Work log SQLite database (WAL).
